In my SKMTC operation Projection's transform, I need to register a model Definition for the response type so other generators can reference it. Here's what I have:

```ts
transform({ operation, context }) {
  const responseSchema = operation.toSuccessResponse().toContent()
  const refName = responseSchema.toRefName()
  const identifier = new Identifier({
    name: capitalize(refName),
    exportPath: `models/${refName}.ts`
  })
  const definition = new Definition({
    identifier,
    generatorKey: toGeneratorOnlyKey({ generatorId: this.generatorId }),
    value: toTsTypeFor(responseSchema),
  })
  this.register({
    definitions: [definition],
    imports: { [`models/${refName}.ts`]: [refName] }
  })
}
```

Is this the idiomatic way to do it?
